graphify-out

# AI-DLC generated artifacts — functions of the tickets, rebuilt by uow_graph.py --write.
# Everything with judgement in it (intent, assumptions, requirements, design, UoW, tickets,
# gate state) stays tracked.
.ai/features/*/05-ticket-graph.md
.ai/features/*/06-traceability.md
.ai/features/*/registry.yaml

# ai-dlc-verify: local-only skill, its generated evidence, and its secrets.
# `.env.*` above does not cover credentials.env — that pattern matches a basename
# beginning with .env, not one ending in it.
.claude/skills/ai-dlc-verify/

# ai-dlc-verify — secrets and generated evidence.
# `.ai/credentials.env` is NOT matched by a `.env*` pattern (that matches a basename
# *beginning* with .env, not one ending in it), and `.ai/.auth/` holds live session
# state — a committed one is a working credential. Verified with `git check-ignore -v`.
.ai/credentials.env
.ai/.auth/
.ai/features/*/08-evidence.md
.ai/features/*/evidence/

